        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: கூடைப்பந்து",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கூடைப்பந்து — kūṭaippantu — \"basketball\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "எங்கள் பள்ளியில் கூடைப்பந்து மைதானம் இருக்கிறது. eṅkaḷ paḷḷiyil kūṭaippantu maitāṉam irukkiṟatu. Our school has a basketball court."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Word for word \"basket-ball\": கூடை (kūṭai) + பந்து (pantu), with the ப் doubled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கூடைப்பந்து (kūṭaippantu) is a native compound made to match English basketball: கூடை (kūṭai), \"a basket\" (DEDR 1884), and பந்து (pantu), \"a ball\" (DEDR 3925)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
